---
# For configuration options and examples, please see:
# https://gethomepage.dev/latest/configs/bookmarks
#
# PERSONAL LINKS ONLY. Anything this homelab hosts belongs in services.yaml.j2 as a tile —
# n8n lived here as a bookmark until 2026-09-09 and is now a tile in the Admin group, so a
# self-hosted service is reachable from one place rather than two.
#
# A `/icons/<file>.png` href reads from the homepage-icons ConfigMap
# (templates/icons-configmap.yaml.j2), which base64s the PNGs in this role's files/ dir.
# Add the PNG to BOTH or the tile renders a broken image. A bare `<name>.png` needs neither:
# homepage resolves it against its bundled dashboard-icons set.

- Bookmarks:
  - Gmail:
    - icon: gmail.png
      href: https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#inbox
  - YouTube:
    - icon: youtube.png
      href: https://www.youtube.com
  - Reddit:
    - icon: reddit.png
      href: https://old.reddit.com/
  - Monarch:
    - icon: /icons/monarch.png
      href: https://app.monarch.com/dashboard
  - Twitter:
    - icon: twitter.png
      href: https://twitter.com/home
